{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/extras/bss-capsule-748-896_1.png?t=1749243954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GET TO WORK, TINY SPIRIT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the center of reality, a corporation harvests mortal moments, like coffee in the morning or movies with friends, from a vast farm of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They package and re-sell these experiences as sentient books to Immortal beings who can never experience such pleasantries for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, when one of those worlds stops turning, its God vanishing into thin air, you are the only one still on your shift at the corp available to investigate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurry up - the shareholders won't wait forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/extras/bss-capsule-748-896_2.png?t=1749243954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Narrative gameplay system where character customization<i> is</i> dialogue options.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open people up by choosing from a variety of personalities you learn along the way.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique 2.5D artstyle inspired by 90's CGI and early adventure games.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 deep, intertwined characters to unravel.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A multi-layered off-kilter world to explore.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get really overwhelmed when you say the wrong things.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your book sidekick hates you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/extras/bss-capsule-748-896_3.png?t=1749243954\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3126340?t=1749243954","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3126340?t=1749243954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/bf793622362501037403599ac60fa98c110650d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749243954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/bf793622362501037403599ac60fa98c110650d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749243954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126340/extras/bss-capsule-748-896_1.png?t=1749243954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GET TO WORK, TINY SPIRIT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the center of reality, a corporation harvests mortal moments, like coffee in the morning or movies with friends, from a vast farm of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They package and re-sell these experiences as sentient books to Immortal beings who can never experience such pleasantries for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, when one of those worlds stops turning, its God vanishing into thin air, you are the only one still on your shift at the corp available to investigate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurry up - the shareholders won't wait forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta